      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_f37f4c407da485f8_1",
        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the case branches: 3'b100 now assigns 8'b0001_0000 (was 8'b0001_000, which is only 7 bits and misaligned), and 3'b111 now assigns 8'b1000_0000 (was 8'b100_0000, only 7 bits). This corrects the one-hot decoder output so a=3'b100 produces bit 4 (00010000) instead of bit 3 (00001000).",
